{"speciesId":233,"names":{"fr":"Porygon2","es":"Porygon2","en":"Porygon2","ja":"ポリゴン２"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"This upgraded version of PORYGON is designed for space exploration. It can't fly, though."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Further research enhanced its abil­ ities. Sometimes, it may exhibit motions that were not programmed."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"This manmade POKéMON evolved from the latest technology. It may have unprog­ rammed reactions."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"PORYGON2 was created by humans using the power of science. The man-made POKéMON has been endowed with artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"PORYGON2 was created by humans using the power of science. The man-made POKéMON has been endowed with artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It was created by humans using the power of science. It has been given artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Further research enhanced its abilities. Sometimes, it may exhibit motions that were not programmed."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"This upgraded version of PORYGON is designed for space exploration. However, it can’t even fly."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"With planetary development software installed, it became capable of working in space."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"With planetary development software installed, it became capable of working in space."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"This upgraded version of PORYGON is designed for space exploration. It can’t fly, however."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Further research enhanced its abilities. Sometimes, it may exhibit motions that were not programmed."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a subi une mise à jour censée lui permettre d’explorer d’autres planètes... C’est un échec."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il a subi une mise à jour censée lui permettre d’explorer d’autres planètes... C’est un échec."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Des recherches poussées ont amélioré ses capacités. Il a appris de nouveaux mouvements."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"La investigación mejoró sus habilidades. A veces, puede actuar de forma no programada."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Further research enhanced its abilities. Sometimes, it may exhibit motions that were not programmed."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"さらに 研究が 進められ 能力が 高まった。ときどき プログラムにない 仕草を 見せる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On lui a installé un logiciel de terraformation pour lui permettre de travailler dans l’espace."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene instalado un avanzado software astrofísico que le permite trabajar en el espacio."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"With planetary development software installed, it became capable of working in space."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"惑星開発用の プログラムが インストールされている。 真空の 宇宙でも 活動できるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Porygon2 fut créé par des humains grâce aux progrès de la science. Ce Pokémon a été doté d’une intelligence artificielle qui lui permet d’apprendre de nouveaux mouvements et des émotions par lui-même."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Porygon2 fue creado por el hombre gracias a los avances de la ciencia. Esta obra humana ha sido provista de inteligencia artificial que le permite aprender gestos y sensaciones nuevas por su cuenta."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Porygon2 was created by humans using the power of science. The man-made Pokémon has been endowed with artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"人間が 科学の 力で つくりだした。 人工 知能を 持たせたので 新しい 仕草や 感情を ひとりで 覚えていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Porygon2 fut créé par des humains grâce aux progrès de la science. Ce Pokémon a été doté d’une intelligence artificielle qui lui permet d’apprendre de nouveaux mouvements et des émotions par lui-même."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Porygon2 fue creado por el hombre gracias a los avances de la ciencia. Esta obra humana ha sido provista de inteligencia artificial que le permite aprender gestos y sensaciones nuevas por su cuenta."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Porygon2 was created by humans using the power of science. The man-made Pokémon has been endowed with artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"人間が 科学の 力で つくりだした。 人工 知能を 持たせたので 新しい 仕草や 感情を ひとりで 覚えていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Cette mise à jour de Porygon a été conçue dans le cadre d’un projet de terraformation, grâce aux avancées scientifiques de l’époque."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Esta versión actualizada de Porygon ha sido dotada de la más avanzada tecnología, lo que, en teoría, le permite explorar otros planetas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"For the purposes of planetary development, Porygon was updated with the most cutting-edge technology available."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"惑星 開発を 視野に 入れ 当時の 最新 技術で ポリゴンを アップデートしたのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Version évoluée de Porygon, créée dans l’espoir de pouvoir un jour terraformer des planètes, un rêve loin d’être concrétisé pour l’instant."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Esta versión de Porygon mejorada se creó para posibilitar la exploración de otros planetas. Por desgracia, este sueño sigue siendo inalcanzable."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Porygon was updated to a new version in readiness for planetary development. But that dream remains unrealized as yet."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"惑星 開発を 目標に ポリゴンを バージョンアップしたが まだまだ 夢には 届かない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Grâce à son intelligence artificielle, il peut apprendre beaucoup de choses par lui-même, qu’elles soient utiles... ou un peu superflues."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon dotado de inteligencia artificial y capacidad de aprendizaje autónomo, aunque a veces aprende cosas que no debería."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"AI has been installed in it. It learns various things all on its own, but it even remembers things it doesn’t need to know."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ＡＩを 搭載。 自力で 様々なことを 学んでいくが 余計なことまで 覚えだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Bien qu’il puisse survivre dans l’espace, il peine malheureusement à se mouvoir en apesanteur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Puede sobrevivir en el espacio, aunque la ausencia de gravedad entorpece sus movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Even though it doesn’t die in the vacuum of space, it can’t move around very well in zero gravity."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"宇宙空間 でも 死なないが 無重力 では うまく 身動きを とることが できない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Fruit de la mise à jour d’un Porygon avec des données spéciales, il peut apprendre et se développer de manière autonome."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se trata de una versión mejorada de Porygon mediante un software especial. Tiene capacidad de aprendizaje autónomo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This is a Porygon that was updated with special data. Porygon2 develops itself by learning about many different subjects all on its own."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ポリゴンを 特別な データで アップデート。 さまざまな ことを 自分で 学び 成長する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Depuis qu’on l’a doté d’une intelligence artificielle, il parle un langage mystérieux que seuls ses congénères comprennent."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Al dotarlo de inteligencia artificial, desarrolló un misterioso lenguaje que solo los miembros de su especie son capaces de comprender."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"After artificial intelligence was implemented in Porygon2, the Pokémon began using a strange language that only other Porygon2 understand."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ＡＩ機能を 搭載した 結果 ポリゴン２ 同士にしか わからない 謎の 言語を 話しはじめた。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"A bizarre item caused this Pokémon to evolve. While it now exhibits many new gestures and expressions, its biology remains inscrutable."}],"varieties":[{"id":233,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor"